abstract: >-
  Calibration files used by the MEGARA data reduction pipeline
  (megaradrp): catalogs of arc lines, the atmospheric extinction at the
  Roque de los Muchachos Observatory and the bad pixel masks of MEGARA,
  the optical Integral-Field Unit and Multi-Object Spectrograph of the
  Gran Telescopio Canarias (GTC).
keywords:
  - MEGARA
  - GTC
  - calibration
  - data reduction
